     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">Your first approach is correct — you want to do a proper rejection sampling.<div><br><div>As always, if you’re not sure go ahead and simulate and compare the two</div><div>approaches.</div><div><br><div></div></div></div></div>"
